OL,3,ATrump's tariffs could shutter this
OL,4,ACanadian town - its residents are
OL,5,Afighting to save it
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs you cross the Ottawa river into
OL,8,FTemiscaming, Quebec, the paper mill
OL,9,Ftakes up much of the horizon.
OL,11,FThe town itself was built over a
OL,12,Fcentury ago, around the mill and the
OL,13,Fregion's forests filled with pine,
OL,14,Fbirch, spruce and fir. Now, the main
OL,15,Femployer and economic anchor sits idle
OL,16,Fafter trade talks broke down between
OL,17,FCanada and the US and President Donald
OL,18,FTrump imposed more tariffs on the
OL,19,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
