OL,3,ATrump's tariffs could shutter this
OL,4,ACanadian town - its residents are
OL,5,Afighting to save it
OL,6,
OL,7,FMost of the mill's 360 employees are
OL,8,Fout of work, kept afloat for the moment
OL,9,Fwith partial pay from government
OL,10,Ftariff-relief.
OL,12,FFor some, like Nadine Suley, the
OL,13,Fshuttering of the mill could mark not
OL,14,Fjust a lost livelihood, but a lost way
OL,15,Fof life.
